    {
      "id": "6b1f3c1e-0005-4c0a-9a51-000000000005",
      "name": "Send welcome email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "PTG_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Get new sign-ups').item.json.Email }}",
        "subject": "You’re on the list for The Path to Greatness",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n<title>You’re on the list for The Path to Greatness</title>\n<style>\n  body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#ebeae7;}\n  a{color:#1d2026;}\n  @media (max-width:620px){\n    .px{padding-left:24px!important;padding-right:24px!important;}\n    .h1{font-size:30px!important;line-height:36px!important;}\n    .q{font-size:24px!important;line-height:32px!important;}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ebeae7;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;mso-hide:all;\">The first page of field work, for while you wait.&#8202;&#847;&#8202;&#847;&#8202;&#847;&#8202;&#847;&#8202;&#847;&#8202;&#847;&#8202;&#847;&#8202;&#847;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#ebeae7;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#f6f5f1;\">\n\n<tr><td style=\"background:#171a20;\">\n  <a href=\"https://eatmediatv.com/pathtogreatness/?utm_source=welcome_email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ptg_prelaunch&utm_content=header\" style=\"display:block;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://eatmediatv.com/pathtogreatness/assets/img/email-header.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"The Path to Greatness. An ascent in twelve levels, by D. Antione Dixon.\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;color:#dfe3ea;font:16px Georgia,serif;background:#171a20;\"></a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:44px 52px 8px;font-family:'EB Garamond',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#1d2026;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font:600 11px/16px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5c6370;\">The first readers’ list</p>\n  <h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:34px;line-height:40px;color:#171a20;\">Thank you for signing up.</h1>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:18px;line-height:29px;\">I will write when <i>The Path to Greatness: An Ascent in Twelve Levels</i> is out and tell you where to get it. Until then you will hear from me rarely, and only with something from the book.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:18px;line-height:29px;\">Every level opens with a question on an otherwise empty page. This is the first one.</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:22px 52px 26px;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td style=\"border-left:2px solid #a05561;padding:4px 0 4px 22px;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;\">\n      <p class=\"q\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-style:italic;font-size:27px;line-height:35px;color:#171a20;\">“What if there is nothing to build—only something to uncover?”</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font:600 11px/16px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5c6370;\">Level I, page 13</p>\n    </td>\n  </tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:0 52px 34px;font-family:'EB Garamond',Georgia,serif;color:#1d2026;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:29px;\">The instruction on the next page: “Stay with that question. Turn the page when it stops being a question and starts being a possibility.”</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:0 52px 36px;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#fbfaf7;border:1px solid #dcdad3;\">\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px;font-family:'EB Garamond',Georgia,serif;color:#1d2026;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font:600 11px/16px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a05561;\">Field work · Level I · page 29</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:31px;color:#171a20;\">The Daily Archaeological Dig</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-style:italic;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#5c6370;\">Ten minutes · morning</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:17px;line-height:27px;\">Each stroke of the brush reveals—it doesn’t add. Answer in writing, plainly.</p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:0 28px 6px;font-family:'EB Garamond',Georgia,serif;color:#1d2026;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:26px;\">\n      <tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:26px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;color:#5c6370;\">1</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;\">One capacity I used today without effort:</td></tr>\n      <tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:26px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;color:#5c6370;\">2</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;\">One “flaw” that, seen plainly, is a strength misread:</td></tr>\n      <tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:26px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;color:#5c6370;\">3</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;\">One thing I chased this week that I already have in some form:</td></tr>\n      <tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:26px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;color:#5c6370;\">4</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;\">What did the culture of manufactured lack try to sell me today?</td></tr>\n      <tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:26px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;border-bottom:1px solid #dcdad3;color:#5c6370;\">5</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dcdad3;border-bottom:1px solid #dcdad3;\">What was revealed—not added—by today’s work?</td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:22px 28px 28px;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background:#171a20;\">\n      <a href=\"https://eatmediatv.com/pathtogreatness/?utm_source=welcome_email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ptg_prelaunch&utm_content=field_work#field-work\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 24px;font:600 12px/14px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:2.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f6f5f1;text-decoration:none;\">Answer it on the site</a>\n    </td></tr></table>\n    <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#5c6370;\">Or on paper, as the book intends. On the site your answers stay in your own browser.</p>\n  </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:0 52px 8px;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;text-align:center;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font:600 10px/16px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5c6370;\">Level I · sacred page</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 30px;font-style:italic;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:#171a20;\">“You were never under construction. You were under excavation.”</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:0 52px 40px;font-family:'EB Garamond',Georgia,serif;color:#1d2026;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:18px;line-height:29px;\">D. Antione Dixon</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#5c6370;\">Author of <i>The Path to Greatness</i></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#383d47;\">P.S. If someone you know reached the goal and still felt unfinished, send them the page: <a href=\"https://eatmediatv.com/pathtogreatness/?utm_source=welcome_email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ptg_prelaunch&utm_content=ps_share\" style=\"color:#1d2026;\">eatmediatv.com/pathtogreatness</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"background:#171a20;padding:26px 52px 30px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;color:#a8afbd;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">You are getting this because this address was entered at eatmediatv.com/pathtogreatness. If that was not you, or you would rather not hear from me, <a href=\"{{ $('Get new sign-ups').item.json['Unsubscribe link'] }}\" style=\"color:#dfe3ea;\">unsubscribe here</a>.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;color:#8891a1;\">E.A.T. Media · Los Angeles, California</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "senderName": "D. Antione Dixon"
        }
      }
    },
