    {
      "id": "6b1f3c1e-0008-4c0a-9a51-000000000008",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 760,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## PTG: Welcome email\nEvery 2 minutes this reads the private sheet **The Path to Greatness · First Readers** (tab Signups). Each row with Status **new** gets the welcome email from the connected Gmail account, then its Status becomes **welcomed** (or **error**, with the reason in Notes).\n\n- To resend to someone, set their Status back to **new** in the sheet.\n- Rows marked **unsubscribed** are never emailed.\n- The email text lives in `automation/pathtogreatness-signups/email/welcome.html` in ImaginariumOzone; rebuild this workflow with `n8n/build_workflow.py` after changing it.\n- Kill switch: switch this workflow off. Sign-ups keep landing in the sheet and will be welcomed when it is back on."
      }
    }
